        "official_en_sha256": "a0afab2733d63eeded1cc969bef0b0fe32afd9abaffec3f83e0d6b2ffdb25b5f"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ふふ。\r\nただ計画通りにやってもつまらないでしょ。",
        "official_en": "Hehe. Well, we <text style=\"italic\">could</> do everything by the book...but where’s the fun in that?",
        "real_en": "Hehe. Just following the plan would be boring, wouldn't it?"
      },
