      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "へぇ、ちょっと意外。\r\n天風が苦戦するなんて。",
        "official_en": "Oh? That’s a surprising turn of events—Aether, struggling in a fight?",
        "real_en": "Oh? I didn’t expect Heavenly Wind Veritas to have trouble in a fight."
      },
