      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "心配しなくてもクリスタルはちゃんと破壊するわよ。\r\n跡形もなく粉々にね。",
        "official_en": "Fret not! I’ll do my part in destroying the Crystals, all right. Why, I’ll crush them into dust so there’s nothing left!",
        "real_en": "Don't worry. I'll destroy the Crystals, all right. I'll smash them into pieces until nothing is left."
      },
