        "official_en_sha256": "f563a84d85fd86a573062ccb6793828438241ca52d9da123a74ad2cfe721244c"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "気にするな。\r\n俺たちの正体が知れたところで計画に影響はない。",
        "official_en": "Worry not. Their knowledge of our identities will have no bearing on our plans.",
        "real_en": "Don't worry. Even if they know who we are, it won't affect the plan."
