      "text": {
        "jp": "水華、しばらく姿も見せずに何をしていた。\r\n計画は動き出しているんだぞ。",
        "official_en": "Alluvion. Where have you been? You’re well aware that our plans are finally in motion, no?",
        "real_en": "Water Bloom, where have you been all this time? The plan is already in motion."
